%% Selenium Boot — Layered Architecture (v3.3.0)
%% A compact, high-level view of the framework and its surroundings.
flowchart TB
    UserCode["<b>User Test Code</b><br/>• BaseTest / BaseApiTest / BaseJUnit5Test / BaseCucumberTest<br/>• BasePage (Page Objects)<br/>• Flows / Step definitions"]

    Core["<b>Selenium Boot Core</b>"]
    subgraph CoreLayer[" "]
        Lifecycle["<b>Lifecycle & Listeners</b><br/>SuiteExecutionListener<br/>TestExecutionListener<br/>RetryListener / RetryAnnotationTransformer<br/>BrowserMatrixListener"]
        Bootstrap["<b>Bootstrap & Config</b><br/>FrameworkBootstrap<br/>ConfigurationLoader / SeleniumBootConfig<br/>SeleniumBootDefaults / CiEnvironmentDetector<br/>ExecutionValidator / SeleniumBootContext"]
        Driver["<b>Driver Management</b><br/>DriverManager (ThreadLocal + Semaphore)<br/>DriverProviderFactory / DriverProviderRegistry<br/>Local / Remote / BrowserStack / SauceLabs Providers"]
        Interaction["<b>Interaction, Waits & Assertions</b><br/>WaitEngine / SelfHealingLocator<br/>Locator / SmartLocator<br/>SeleniumAssert / LocatorAssert / SoftAssertions"]
        Evidence["<b>Evidence, Metrics & Tracing</b><br/>ExecutionMetrics / TestTiming<br/>ScreenshotManager / RecordingManager<br/>StepLogger / TraceRecorder<br/>HealLog"]
        ContextData["<b>Context, Data & Preconditions</b><br/>ScenarioContext / SuiteContext<br/>TestData / TestDataStore / ExcelDataReader<br/>PreCondition / PreConditionRunner / BaseConditions"]
    end

    Infra["<b>Infrastructure Services</b><br/>• ApiClient / ApiResponse / ApiAuth<br/>• Browser Helpers (Console, Downloads, Storage, DeviceEmulator)<br/>• MultiSessionManager<br/>• Email / DB / NetworkMock / TestClock<br/>• AccessibilityChecker / PerformanceCollector / VisualAssert<br/>• AiFailureAnalyzer / TestManagement / FlakinessAnalyzer / Quarantine"]

    Reporting["<b>Reporting Pipeline</b><br/>ReportAdapterRegistry<br/>HtmlReportAdapter / HtmlReportGenerator<br/>AllureReportAdapter<br/>JUnitXmlReporter / NotificationAdapter"]

    Ext["<b>Extension Points (SPI / Programmatic)</b><br/>NamedDriverProvider<br/>ReportAdapter<br/>ExecutionHook<br/>SeleniumBootPlugin<br/>BaseConditions + @ConditionProvider"]

    External["<b>External Systems</b><br/>• Selenium WebDriver → Chrome / Firefox / Grid / Cloud<br/>• TestNG / JUnit 5 Platform / Cucumber<br/>• selenium-boot.yml / CI environments<br/>• Jackson / SnakeYAML / axe-core / java.net.http"]

    UserCode -->|extends / uses| Core
    Core -->|uses| Infra
    Core -->|emits metrics| Reporting
    Ext -->|plugs into| Core
    Infra -->|drives| External
    Core -->|integrates with| External
    Reporting -->|reads| Evidence
    Bootstrap -->|loads| External
